    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The paradoxical two-color headline—“The signature is valid. The intent was stolen.”—is memorable, and the cyan/red evidence paths make the desktop feel like an investigation rather than a standard dashboard. However, the visual concept weakens at tablet and largely disappears on mobile, where disconnected stacked cards read as generic cyber-dashboard UI. The header’s tiny scrolling labels are atmospheric but not distinctive enough to restore the lost narrative.",
